Why Is Demand Increasing
Growing Health Consciousness: Increasing consumer focus on physical fitness is encouraging more households to create dedicated workout spaces at home.
Convenience of Home Workouts: Consumers are increasingly choosing flexible home-based exercise solutions that reduce dependence on commercial gyms.
Smart Fitness Innovation: AI trainers, IoT connectivity, virtual training, and connected fitness platforms are creating more engaging and personalized workout experiences.

